              "id": "n3991",
              "width": 1480.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 原来的「型号数」列并入「型号」列（显示「共 N 个」），仍可按型号数排序；其他列（等级、来源、报价截止、创建时间等）不变，图中省略。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "#4B5563"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n3992",
              "width": 1480.0,
              "height": "fit_content",
              "content": "· 待解析、解析中、解析失败的询盘三列都显示「—」；待确认的询盘按 AI 识别结果显示。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
